1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,779
One coin a day. That is the whole plan.

2
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,011
Spring. Summer. Autumn. I did not skip a single day.

3
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:31,012
Then winter, and every shop was singing for my coin.

4
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,233
Not today. I am saving.

5
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:44,854
Day 365.

6
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:48,900
(Shopkeeper) 365 G. Ready to buy?

7
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:51,603
One red kite, please.

8
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,026
Worth every day.
